        `listed activity` "home visits to all the children" `kindergarten teachers`,
        @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_17__ssec_1_17_2/p95
        `listed activity` "advising parents on individual care of weak children not otherwise cared for" `kindergarten teachers`,
        @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_17__ssec_1_17_2/p96
        `listed activity` "guiding groups of volunteers" `kindergarten teachers`,
        @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_17__ssec_1_17_2/p97
        `listed activity` "planning meetings of kindergarten children with first-graders" `kindergarten teachers`,
        @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_17__ssec_1_17_2/p98
        `listed activity` "planning joint activities for a group of kindergartens" `kindergarten teachers`,
        @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_17__ssec_1_17_2/p99 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_17__ssec_1_17_2/p100 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_17__ssec_1_17_2/p101
        `listed activity` "special projects in the kindergarten beyond the usual activity" `rhythmics teachers`,
